    <!-- Orient harbour defenses: the six Old World guns, built from the Enbesa towers where Enbesa has one.
         Palm Planks (1400201040) replace Wanza Wood (114356), Rammed Earth (1404009000) replaces Mud Bricks (114402)
         and Bricks (1010205). Models: local Orient reskins of the Enbesa towers in buildings/orient/harbor_defense_orient
         (cream plaster, sandstone courses, green pennant); Big Betty keeps the vanilla Old World model.
         Quay: the New World one like every Orient harbour building (2026-10-13).
         Every clone is anchored on its own base: a clone placed before its base in assets.xml is a name-only,
         unbuildable asset (823, 4799 and 743 sit after 117863, so Fire, AP and Flak never showed; fixed 2026-11-13).
         Menus: nomads (1404000215) Puckle Gun, Cannon, Flak; envoys (1404000615) Fire, Armour Piercing, Big Betty.
         Pools: 1404004120 (Puckle Gun, Cannon, Flak; 1.3) and 1404004121 (Fire; 2.1); AP and Big Betty at 2.4.
         The flak keeps the Empire of the Skies DLCDependency of 743.
         On the ai_settlement branch they are also the AI's DefenseStructures for Mod3. -->
